---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { TV_PROFILE } from '../data/indicators';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Itto-Ryu Tech: open-source Pine Script indicators, grown with patience.">
  <article class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 pt-16">
    <span lang="ja" class="vertical absolute right-4 sm:right-6 top-16 text-lg tracking-[0.15em] text-usu" aria-hidden="true">明鏡止水</span>
    <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-koke font-medium">About</p>
    <div class="mt-6 font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-[1.5] space-y-3 pr-10">
      <p>A bonsai is not made in a day.</p>
      <p>It is grown with patience and shaped by careful cuts. Trading is the same.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-5 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      <p>
        Itto-Ryu Tech is a one-person practice: a TFEX and SET50 trader who writes open-source Pine Script
        indicators and publishes them free on{' '}
        <a href={TV_PROFILE} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="underline text-koke hover:text-matsuba">TradingView</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        The name comes from the idea of one deliberate cut, the kind a gardener makes when shaping a tree.
        The guiding phrase <span lang="ja">明鏡止水</span> (meikyō shisui, "a clear mirror, still water")
        is a reminder that a still mind reads the chart more clearly.
      </p>
      <p class="text-usu">
        Itto-Ryu Tech is not affiliated with any Ittō-ryū school of swordsmanship, and is not affiliated with
        or endorsed by TradingView.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 rounded-md bg-kinu p-5 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-koke font-medium">Disclaimer</p>
      <p class="mt-2">For education only. Not investment advice. Indicators describe market conditions; they do not predict prices.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
